   '2019-02-27', null, '2026-10-18T00:00:00Z', 'a7ce8d0be2779f4ce4577e65a7ba7172e656728d106086681d1ca50287d92104', 'extracted', 'unreviewed', 'Date basis: printed in the running title. An older chapter; the Army G-1 page lists it as current (uploaded 8 Aug 2022). Imported for 27A: the grade-by-grade development sections (O-4, O-5, O-6) as the pamphlet gives them for the branch or functional area; they apply to every AOC listed. Duties and prerequisites are not imported from this pamphlet (DA PAM 611-21 is the source); figures and tables are not extracted. The run imported is the Major, Lieutenant Colonel and Colonel development text for judge advocates; company grade officers are described in a different part of the chapter and are not imported. Applies to 27A; the military judge AOC (27B) is not covered. LIMITATIONS: The run imported is the Major, Lieutenant Colonel and Colonel development text for judge advocates; company grade officers are described in a different part of the chapter and are not imported. Applies to 27A; the military judge AOC (27B) is not covered.', 'pdf-parse 2.4.5', 'army-600-3-2-jag-corps-da-pam-600-3@2026-10-18', '185a6c1a21e2d9babed2b83a10ed8dddf81887ee22a688e2baf972f4834409c7')
